  "created": "2026-05-11T06:28:01.793Z",
  "description": "A user-friendly .NET library on top of the Verica PDF engine. Provides a fluent PdfBuilder, async services with CancellationToken, Stream-first overloads, a unified PdfOperationResult, page-range parsing (\"1-3,5,7-9\"), DI integration (AddPdfVerica), and ILogger<T> diagnostics across reading, writing, transforming, annotating, encrypting, signing, form filling, HTML/Markdown conversion, and PDF/A & PDF/UA compliance validation.",
  "id": "PdfVerica",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-05-12T05:05:33Z",
