  "published": "1900-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.1.0 - Refactored as a reusable class library. Removed OCR and barcode modules. Added fluent PdfBuilder, async + CancellationToken across services, Stream overloads, unified PdfOperationResult, shared PageRangeParser, ILogger<T> diagnostics, AddPdfVerica() DI registration, and PdfDrawioConverter (converts .drawio XML compressed or raw, .drawio.svg, and .png exports with embedded mxfile metadata to PDF).",
